sequenceDiagram
  %% status: draft
  %% kind: node.base_inventory
  autonumber
  participant U as Caller
  participant G as Gateway
  participant S as Swamp worker
  participant N as Target Node
  U->>G: Request inventory<br/>NODE
  Note over G: Check target grant<br/>Use the recorded host pin
  G->>S: Start fixed inventory<br/>Private verifier reference
  G-->>U: Queued Operation
  S->>N: Read the Node<br/>Pinned SSH and fixed collector
  N-->>S: Report observations<br/>Metadata and match results
  S-->>G: Publish inventory
  U->>G: Read Operation
  G-->>U: Inventory<br/>Agent and Doctor evidence
